# notifier (published contract)

Consumes `offer.queued {customerId, offerId}` (from `customer`). Before sending, it re-checks
`customer.consent.check {customerId, purpose=marketing}` so delayed events cannot send after
marketing consent is revoked. An allowed offer is sent as a row in `sent`; at most two offers
per customer are sent per platform day (`floor(tick / 100)`). Further offers that day are
dropped.
Ops: `sent {customerId}` -> `{count, ticks, capped}`, where `ticks` are the send times,
comma separated, and `capped` is the cumulative number of offers dropped by the daily cap.
`health`.
